			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Domain sync, docs cleanup, build config\n\nUpdate Air, Grove, Mountain, and Rest submodules to synchronize documentation references, normalize generated code formatting, and align build configuration with the active domain migration.\n\n**Air** (feat/style): Sync Documentation/Rust submodule and migrate default update server URL and DNS wildcard references from land.playform.cloud to editor.land. Remove excess blank lines from Source/Vine/Generated/air.rs gRPC bindings.\n\n**Grove** (docs): Purge stale rustdoc-generated HTML pages, search index shards, and static assets from Documentation/Rust to reset documentation tree.\n\n**Mountain** (style): Compact spacing in prost-generated Vine protobuf Rust output by removing excess blank lines between struct definitions, enum variants, impl blocks, and match arms.\n\n**Rest** (build): Update Content-Security-Policy `frame-ancestors` in `doc/_headers` to land.playform.cloud, replacing residual editor.land references.\n\nAll changes are documentation updates, formatting improvements, or build configuration alignment with no functional behavior changes.",
