			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Domain migration, rebuilds, and docs\n\nUpdate nine element submodules to synchronize domain references, rebuild generated artifacts, and consolidate documentation:\n\n**Air** (refactor): Update default update URL and migrate DNS documentation/tests from *.land.playform.cloud to *.editor.land, plus remove excess blank lines from generated protobuf code.\n\n**Mist** (fix): Reconcile DNS isolation server to use land.playform.cloud as authoritative zone, replacing residual editor.land references across resolver, zone, and forwarding configuration.\n\n**Mountain** (feat): Replace land.playform.cloud with editor.land in DNS allowlists, zone records, certificate hostnames, and service registry fixtures.\n\n**SideCar** (fix): Update DNS override comment from editor.land to land.playform.cloud.\n\n**Cocoon** (chore): Regenerate RouteManifest timestamp and rebuild all Target/ artifacts across bootstrap, effect, IPC, service, handler, gRPC, type converter, webview panel, and platform layers.\n\n**Output** (build): Regenerate 39 ESBuild source map files under Configuration/ to match updated bundled artifacts.\n\n**Wind** (build): Regenerate Effect-TS upstream service bindings with additions for auto-update delays, Windows MXC sandbox, agent sessions, and interface renaming.\n\n**Rest** (docs): Correct Rust API documentation URL casing to lowercase canonical endpoint.\n\n**Vine** (docs): Consolidate protocol architecture into unified Vine.proto representation and remove deprecated Spine layer references.\n\nAll changes are domain references, generated artifacts, or documentation updates with no functional behavior changes.",
